:''Not to be confused with the stage [[Wicked Cat]], the Cat Unit counterpart [[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Cat]], or [[Malevolent Mohawk Cat]].''
'''Wicked Cat''' (邪悪なネコ, ''Jaakuna Neko'', '''Wicked Cat''') is a [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]]-turned-[[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] introduced in the [[Wicked Cat]] event, which is unlocked after clearing [[Arcane Confluence]]. Although [[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Cat]] is visually an allied counterpart of Wicked Cat, it is not obtained by defeating this enemy, but rather from [[:Category:Seasonal Gacha Events|seasonal]] [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] events. It was added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]].

